hadiths[9]{hadithnumber,text}:
"254","Diyat kitni hai: al-Haytham ibn Khalid al-Juhani ne hum se bayan kiya, Waki ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan se, Ayyub ibn Musa se, Makhul se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki wafat hui jabke diyat aath sau dinar thi, phir un ke baad Hazrat Umar ne andesha kiya, to unhon ne use barah hazar dirham ya ek hazar dinar muqarrar kar diya."
"255","Abu Kamil ne hum se bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Zuray' ne hum se bayan kiya, Husayn ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr ibn Shu'ayb se riwayat hai: ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke zamane mein diyat ki qeemat aath sau dinar thi."
"256","Wahb ibn Bayan, Ibn al-Sarh aur Ahmad ibn Sa'id ne kaha: Ibn Wahb ne humein khabar di, Yunus ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Shihab se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Maine Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke us khat mein padha jo unhon ne Amr ibn Hazm ko likha jab unhein Najran ki taraf bheja - aur woh khat Abu Bakr ibn Hazm ke paas tha - Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne us mein likha: Ye Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki taraf se bayan hai: (Aye iman walo, ahdon ko poora karo). Aur unhon ne us mein se aayaat likhin yahan tak ke (Beshak Allah jald hisab lene wala hai) tak pahunche. Phir unhon ne likha: Ye zakhamon ka bayan hai: Jaan ke badle sau oont; naak ke badle jab us ka kaatna mukammal ho sau oont; aankh ke badle pachaas oont; kaan ke badle pachaas oont; haath ke badle pachaas oont; paon ke badle pachaas oont; un mein se har ungli ke badle das oont; ma'mumah (dimagh ki jhilli tak pahunchne wale zakham) ke badle ek tihai diyat-e-jaan; ja'ifah (aar-paar hone wale zakham) ke badle ek tihai diyat-e-jaan; munaqqilah (haddi ko apni jagah se hatane wali toot-phoot) ke badle pandrah; mudihah (haddi ko zahir karne wale zakham) ke badle paanch oont; aur daant ke badle paanch oont. Ibn Shihab ne kaha: Ye wohi hai jo maine us khat mein padha jo Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne likha tha, jo Abu Bakr ibn Hazm ke paas tha. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ye muttasil sanad se riwayat kiya gaya hai lekin sahih nahin hai; Yahya ibn Hamzah ne use Sulayman ibn Arqam se, al-Zuhri se, Abu Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se riwayat kiya hai."
"257","Abu Hubayrah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne ise Yahya ibn Hamzah ke asl nuskhe mein parha; mujhe Sulayman ibn Arqam ne bayan kiya. Aur Harun ibn Muhammad ibn Bakkar ne hum se bayan kiya; mujhe mere walid aur mere chacha ne bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Yahya ibn Hamzah, Sulayman ibn Arqam se, isi tarah. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Jo Sulayman ibn Dawud ne kaha, us mein us ne ghalati ki."
"258","al-Hakam ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, hamen Yahya ibn Hamzah ne bayan kiya, Sulayman ibn Dawud [al-Khawlani - siqah -] se, unhon ne al-Zuhri se, unhon ne Abu Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se; al-Hakam ne is mein ghalati ki."
"259","Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, hamen Hammad ne bayan kiya, hamen Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Amr ibn Hazm se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke khat mein - yani is wale mein - tha: Zakar mein diyat hai; aur zaban mein diyat hai."
"260","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, hamen Hammad ne bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ishaq se, unhon ne Makhul se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Zaban mein diyat hai; zakar mein diyat hai; aur aage ke danton mein paanch paanch faraiz hain."
"261","Muhammad ibn [Abdullah] ne hum se bayan kiya, hamen Abd al-Rahman, yani Ibn Maghra, ne bayan kiya, hamen Muhammad, yani Ibn Ishaq, ne bayan kiya. Main ne Makhul ko kehte hue suna: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne unsayain mein diyat ka faisla farmaya."
"262","Qutaybah ne hum se bayan kiya, hamen al-Layth ne bayan kiya, Ibn al-Had se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: [Hazrat Rasool Allah] (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Sulb mein diyat hai."
